<title>USA: Butler National tests food store.</title>
<headline>Butler National tests food store.</headline>
<dateline>OLATHE, Kan. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Butler National Corp said Thursday it has opened a prototype Valu Foods store in Burlington, Kansas.</p>
<p>The store is aimed at small communities that are not near discount food outlets, the company said.</p>
<p>The store sells restaurant quality frozen meats, pasta, vegetables and desserts, the company said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
